for rival governor candidates.

00:02:34.133 --> 00:02:35.267
-Ooh.

00:02:35.267 --> 00:02:37.033
[ Audience "Oohs" ]
-But this is sweet.

00:02:37.033 --> 00:02:38.567
After his rally,
Trump's gonna direct

00:02:38.567 --> 00:02:42.033
