[ Laughter ]

00:03:11.434 --> 00:03:12.734
Some more business news --
I heard that DoorDash

00:03:12.734 --> 00:03:16.267
is now requiring their drivers
who deliver alcohol

00:03:16.267 --> 00:03:19.267
